 "allowed_sentences": [
  "On 365 of the 365 measured effective cross sections in UKAEA's integro-differential validation table distributed by the IAEA's CoNDERC (FNG, TU Dresden and JAEA-FNS fusion spectra), ACTINV with its default TENDL-2025 library had a median |ln(C/E)| of 0.160 against 0.138 for FISPACT-II with TENDL-2017 as published in the same table; FISPACT-II's values were closer to the measurements (paired Wilcoxon signed-rank test, two-sided p = 1.8e-07).",
  "Within twice the experimental uncertainty were 55% of ACTINV's values and 64% of FISPACT-II's; on the 181 FNG and TU Dresden values alone, FISPACT-II's values were closer to the measurements (p = 7.1e-05).",
  "The calculated values are spectrum-averaged cross sections, so the comparison measures the nuclear data each code used (TENDL-2025 against TENDL-2017) more than the codes themselves."
